# func/text/tx_fm (id 333): FIND / SEARCH matcher over unpacked units (one per word): pattern at F (T3,
# length Lf T1), text at W (T4, length Lw T2), S = T5 (1: SEARCH wildcards ? * and ~ escapes).
# Registers: p AS (start position, 0-based), i AR1, j AC1, si C.TAG (pattern index after the last *,
# -1 none), sj C.PAY (text index the last * started from), pc B.TAG, wid B.PAY (pattern units the
# current token spans), wild A.TAG (current token is ?). Prefix match with backtracking to the last *.
# PC 0: i >= Lf -> A = (1, p + 1), exit; else read F[i], PC 1. Exits go to (LR, LP) (tx_fs sets 322, 0).
# PC 1: x0 = pattern unit. S and *: si = i + 1 ... (si = i, sj = j, i += 1), PC 0. S and ~ with a next
#   unit: read F[i + 1], PC 2. Else token = x0 (wild = S and ?), wid 1: tail.
# PC 2: x0 = unit after ~: one of ? * ~ -> literal x0, wid 2; else literal ~, wid 1: tail.
# tail: j < Lw -> read W[j], PC 3; else mismatch. PC 3: wild or x0 = pc -> i += wid, j += 1, PC 0;
#   else mismatch. mismatch: si >= 0 and sj < Lw -> sj += 1, j = sj, i = si + 1, PC 0; else p += 1:
#   p >= Lw -> A = #VALUE! -> tx_fin; else i = 0, j = p, si = -1, PC 0.
# Note: weights/func/text/tx_match.md
